.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH xil-regen 1  "xil-regen " 
.SH NAME
xil\-regen \- Regenerate a production script markdown from parsed JSON.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxil\-regen\fR [\fB\-\-episode\fR] [\fB\-\-tag\fR] [\fB\-\-parsed\fR] [\fB\-\-cast\fR] [\fB\-\-sfx\fR] [\fB\-\-show\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-speakers\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Regenerate a production script markdown from parsed JSON.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-episode\fR \fI<EPISODE>\fR
Episode tag (e.g. S02E03)
.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI<TAG>\fR
Raw tag for non\-episodic content (e.g. V01C03, D01)
.TP
\fB\-\-parsed\fR \fI<PARSED>\fR
Override parsed JSON path
.TP
\fB\-\-cast\fR \fI<CAST>\fR
Override cast config path
.TP
\fB\-\-sfx\fR \fI<SFX>\fR
Override SFX config path (sfx_<TAG>.json); when supplied, direction entries are emitted with a pipe\-hint suffix carrying the source filename and any play_volume_pct / play_duration_pct override
.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI<SHOW>\fR
Show name override (default: from project.json)
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
Output markdown path (default: scripts/revised_<slug>_{TAG}.md)
.TP
\fB\-\-speakers\fR \fI<SPEAKERS>\fR
Path to speakers.json (default: auto\-detect from CWD, then built\-in)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
